WEBVTT

01:33.820 --> 01:36.160
OUR GENERATION

01:36.200 --> 01:39.160
EPISODE 12

01:39.200 --> 01:44.200
JIALIN EXPERIMENTAL HIGH SCHOOL

01:46.860 --> 01:48.600
Thanks, Ms. Bye.

01:52.180 --> 01:53.540
Congrats, Lin Yingtao.

01:53.580 --> 01:55.500
You used to be the last one
out of detention.

01:55.540 --> 01:57.500
Today, you are second to last.

01:58.080 --> 01:59.720
That's real progress.

01:59.760 --> 02:01.460
You're improving so fast,
I'm getting nervous.

02:02.020 --> 02:04.560
If next time you beat me out the door,

02:04.600 --> 02:05.800
does that mean I'm slipping?

02:06.620 --> 02:08.780
Use those big eyes of yours, will you?

02:08.820 --> 02:10.460
Didn't you see it
when I handed in my paper?

02:10.500 --> 02:12.020
I didn't hand it in late.

02:12.060 --> 02:13.820
I was asking the teacher questions.

02:13.860 --> 02:14.900
What's with the face?

02:16.260 --> 02:17.180
What,

02:17.220 --> 02:18.420
physics finally make sense now?

02:21.000 --> 02:23.300
Jiang Qiaoxi taught me a trick.

02:23.340 --> 02:24.500
He said,

02:24.540 --> 02:26.400
if you don't know the answer,

02:26.440 --> 02:28.700
ask yourself why the question
was asked that way.

02:28.740 --> 02:30.260
So I tried that, and suddenly,

02:30.300 --> 02:32.780
every physics question
felt like a universal one.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.640
Lin Yingtao,

02:34.680 --> 02:36.980
sounds like you just unlocked
your inner genius.

02:37.020 --> 02:38.460
Even I'm a little shocked.

02:38.500 --> 02:40.800
Not to mention Cai Fangyuan,
you might outgrow me soon.

02:40.840 --> 02:43.000
Are you joining the Physics Olympiad?

02:43.040 --> 02:43.960
Into the prodigy club?

02:44.000 --> 02:45.120
Let's not go that far.

02:45.160 --> 02:47.460
She's already 17. Missed the cutoff years
for being a prodigy.

02:48.620 --> 02:50.460
Don't let it get to you, Yingtao.

02:50.500 --> 02:51.660
Enough from you two.

02:51.700 --> 02:52.840
You never say anything nice.

02:52.880 --> 02:54.300
Come on,

02:54.340 --> 02:56.740
today is a big day for Qunshan Squard.

02:56.780 --> 02:58.360
Wonder if Qin Yeyun and Du Shang

02:58.400 --> 02:59.500
got the fireworks.

03:02.460 --> 03:03.700
Careful.

03:03.740 --> 03:04.840
- I got this, Dad.
- Yun,

03:04.880 --> 03:05.900
careful behind you.

03:08.780 --> 03:09.620
Shuangyan,

03:11.140 --> 03:12.360
this is serious now.

03:12.400 --> 03:13.480
They're serious about it.

03:13.520 --> 03:15.660
Listen to me. I've thought about it.

03:15.700 --> 03:16.720
You being here

03:16.760 --> 03:17.600
really helps me out.

03:19.860 --> 03:21.560
- Qin…
- Yun and Du Shang

03:21.600 --> 03:23.020
already talked.

03:23.880 --> 03:25.100
Du Shang thinks

03:25.140 --> 03:26.120
it's a good idea.

03:26.700 --> 03:28.080
Du Shang is a good kid.

03:28.120 --> 03:30.900
He doesn't want his mom
outside in the cold,

03:30.940 --> 03:32.400
getting chased off by the city patrol.

03:32.440 --> 03:33.660
You can stay here.

03:33.700 --> 03:34.920
Set up stall and do your thing.

03:37.080 --> 03:39.080
Qin, how about this?

03:39.120 --> 03:40.300
I'll give you twenty percent

03:40.340 --> 03:42.120
of what I make on skewers as stall rent.

03:42.160 --> 03:44.280
- It that okay?
- No.

03:45.160 --> 03:47.120
A proper storefront goes for way more.

03:47.780 --> 03:48.960
Twenty percent is very low.

03:49.000 --> 03:50.140
I'm already getting a bargain.

03:52.600 --> 03:53.440
Tell you what,

03:54.220 --> 03:57.060
let's treat this

03:57.100 --> 03:59.280
like a probation period.

03:59.320 --> 04:02.040
Set up your stall here, try it out.

04:02.080 --> 04:04.040
See how it goes after a month.

04:04.080 --> 04:05.060
We'll talk after that.

04:07.760 --> 04:08.600
Alright.

04:10.180 --> 04:11.860
Yun, Du Shang,

04:11.900 --> 04:13.440
should we treat ourselves

04:13.480 --> 04:14.540
and go out to eat tonight?

04:14.580 --> 04:16.560
Celebrate our grand collaboration.

04:17.339 --> 04:18.680
Why go out and spend money?

04:18.720 --> 04:20.899
We can eat at home. I'll cook.

04:20.940 --> 04:23.880
Mom, we are heading to the beach later.
Rain check?

04:24.540 --> 04:25.560
Looks like we'll be getting

04:25.600 --> 04:27.100
more of Auntie Shuangyan's cooking.

04:27.140 --> 04:28.940
That sour-and-spicy fern noodles dish

04:28.980 --> 04:30.480
you made last time? So good.

04:30.520 --> 04:31.660
Can we have that tomorrow?

04:31.700 --> 04:32.820
You got it.

04:32.860 --> 04:34.000
Qin Yeyun,

04:34.040 --> 04:35.320
from now on,

04:35.360 --> 04:36.660
you get top pick on the menu.

04:38.460 --> 04:39.300
Let go.

04:43.840 --> 04:45.880
Pack of Chunghwa, Qin.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.880
And a Want Want gift snack box too.

04:51.180 --> 04:52.500
Don't just stand there.

04:52.540 --> 04:54.100
Make it a soft pack.

04:54.140 --> 04:54.980
Keep the change.

04:57.100 --> 04:57.940
Shuangyan.

05:08.500 --> 05:09.640
Son.

05:15.060 --> 05:16.900
- Cao Shuangyan, what is this?
- Stop!

05:16.940 --> 05:18.040
How could you do this?

05:18.080 --> 05:20.240
I work my butt off out there,
barely get to come home.

05:20.280 --> 05:21.760
- You couldn't cook some trotters?
- Enough.

05:21.800 --> 05:23.140
You don't want me here, do you?

05:24.760 --> 05:25.940
You just don't want me back.

05:26.520 --> 05:27.640
Mom!

05:50.400 --> 05:51.240
Hey, Yingtao?

05:52.360 --> 05:53.200
Jiang Qiaoxi.

05:53.760 --> 05:54.980
We'll have to cancel

05:55.020 --> 05:55.860
tonight's plan.

06:11.300 --> 06:12.500
Anything?

06:12.540 --> 06:13.860
- Nothing.
- No sound.

06:17.960 --> 06:18.840
Du Shang!

06:18.880 --> 06:20.900
- Du Shang!
- Open the door!

06:20.940 --> 06:22.420
Come on, Du Shang! Hurry up!

06:22.460 --> 06:23.700
- Du Shang!
- Who is it?

06:31.540 --> 06:33.520
These kids…

06:33.560 --> 06:34.420
What's up, Yingtao?

06:36.420 --> 06:37.900
We're looking for Du Shang.

06:39.140 --> 06:39.980
- Coming!
- He…

06:40.020 --> 06:41.520
Yingtao. You made it, guys.

06:41.560 --> 06:42.400
Is everything okay?

06:46.680 --> 06:47.580
Yeah.

06:47.620 --> 06:49.060
I was just cooking with my dad.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.520
Son.

06:52.380 --> 06:54.440
Yingtao. Perfect timing.

06:54.480 --> 06:56.380
You're all here. Auntie Cao and I,

06:56.420 --> 06:57.720
we made a whole spread.

06:57.760 --> 06:59.440
You haven't eaten yet? Come on in.

06:59.480 --> 07:00.740
We're good, really.

07:00.780 --> 07:01.900
- Actually,
- We're good.

07:01.940 --> 07:03.120
we already ate.

07:03.160 --> 07:04.720
Don't be shy, kids.

07:06.160 --> 07:07.340
Fine.

07:13.900 --> 07:15.500
Uncle Du looks different now.

07:16.140 --> 07:17.180
His temper seems changed.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.220
Looks like it.

07:19.260 --> 07:20.280
Then maybe

07:20.320 --> 07:22.160
Du Shang won't get beaten up anymore.

07:24.880 --> 07:26.060
Wait a second.

07:26.100 --> 07:29.400
- Are you okay? You sure?
- I'm fine.

07:30.280 --> 07:32.080
The fireworks are ready.
You can head to the beach.

07:32.740 --> 07:33.940
It's fine.

07:33.980 --> 07:35.420
Let's do it another time.

07:36.360 --> 07:38.520
Have dinner with your parents tonight.

07:39.160 --> 07:41.440
You're going to that winter camp, right?

07:41.480 --> 07:43.320
It'll be even colder after that.
Not a good time.

07:43.360 --> 07:45.300
This is not the only winter
we will ever get.

07:46.560 --> 07:47.400
Besides,

07:47.440 --> 07:49.820
I got more than just fireworks.

07:53.580 --> 07:54.420
Go. Go on.

07:54.460 --> 07:55.800
- Alright. I'm off.
- We will rearrange.

07:57.760 --> 07:58.820
You little rat.

07:58.860 --> 08:00.320
- Bye.
- Bye.

08:06.460 --> 08:07.820
Alright, stop worrying.

08:07.860 --> 08:09.220
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.600
INBOX, JIANG QIAOXI, VIEW MESSAGE

08:39.640 --> 08:42.480
HOP ON YOUR BIKES.
MEET AT THE GATE. LET'S RIDE TO SCHOOL.

08:48.580 --> 08:49.860
- Morning!
- Morning.

08:49.900 --> 08:52.040
- Morning.
- Where is Jiang Qiaoxi?

08:52.080 --> 08:52.920
Not here yet.

08:54.420 --> 08:56.680
Morning! I'm here!

08:57.640 --> 08:58.720
- Morning.
- Hey, Jiang Qiaoxi.

08:58.760 --> 08:59.960
Slow down.

09:03.460 --> 09:04.580
Sorry to keep you waiting.

09:05.480 --> 09:07.120
Weren't you heading to the Olympiad?

09:07.160 --> 09:08.760
Why are you ride to school with us?

09:08.800 --> 09:09.940
You even reminded us

09:09.980 --> 09:11.920
to bring our bikes.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.280
Before I go,

09:13.320 --> 09:14.540
what I want to do most is to

09:14.580 --> 09:15.740
ride to school with all of you.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.580
What's that you are holding?

09:20.140 --> 09:21.100
Yingtao said,

09:21.600 --> 09:23.220
if I want to officially rejoin

09:23.260 --> 09:24.120
the Qunshan Squard,

09:24.660 --> 09:26.380
I need to "melt your icy hearts".

09:26.420 --> 09:28.780
So you went with the easiest way,

09:28.820 --> 09:31.180
- giving out gifts?
- Exactly.

09:31.220 --> 09:32.380
I brought them.

09:32.420 --> 09:34.120
Just not sure
if you are brave enough to accept.

09:34.800 --> 09:36.080
With a setup like that,

09:36.120 --> 09:38.200
how could we not take them?

09:41.180 --> 09:43.180
One scarf for each of you.

09:43.220 --> 09:44.320
Hand-knit by Qiaoxi.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.920
You knit these yourself?

09:47.960 --> 09:50.800
- Of course.
- You knit scarves? Since when?

09:50.840 --> 09:52.060
It's not that hard.

09:52.100 --> 09:53.780
It's basically just applying formulas.

09:54.960 --> 09:55.920
This one is for you.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.620
It took more time for a colored pattern.

09:58.520 --> 09:59.500
I see.

09:59.540 --> 10:00.660
- Jiang Qiaoxi,
- Let me see.

10:00.700 --> 10:01.800
your world is made of math.

10:03.720 --> 10:05.160
Thinking about Jiang Qiaoxi sit there

10:05.200 --> 10:06.920
and knitting. It feels peculiar.

10:06.960 --> 10:08.960
Stop, I am picturing it, too.

10:43.240 --> 10:44.280
Honestly,

10:44.320 --> 10:45.960
when I couldn't hang out with you guys,

10:46.660 --> 10:47.620
I got so bored

10:48.160 --> 10:49.400
I had to find something to do.

10:50.140 --> 10:51.600
If scarves are not enough,

10:51.640 --> 10:52.640
I can knit sweaters next.

10:52.680 --> 10:53.600
Jiang Qiaoxi,

10:53.640 --> 10:55.180
let's not get ahead of ourselves.

10:55.220 --> 10:57.600
These scarves are already a lot.

10:59.420 --> 11:00.860
Why red, by the way?

11:00.900 --> 11:01.860
I like red.

11:02.580 --> 11:04.560
We all thought you were into black.

11:04.600 --> 11:06.380
Black was never a choice.

11:07.280 --> 11:09.220
But red is.

11:09.260 --> 11:11.980
But this red is blinding.

11:12.020 --> 11:13.060
It's like a traffic light.

11:13.600 --> 11:14.980
I've never worn anything this red.

11:16.200 --> 11:17.840
Stop nitpicking.

11:18.480 --> 11:19.980
Red is great.

11:20.020 --> 11:21.100
It's like the sun,

11:21.140 --> 11:22.560
bright, warm and hopeful.

11:22.600 --> 11:23.820
I like it.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.520
I'm keeping mine.

11:25.560 --> 11:26.700
Thanks, Jiang Qiaoxi.

11:27.240 --> 11:28.700
You like it, take it.

11:28.740 --> 11:29.820
This is definitely not for me.

11:30.360 --> 11:32.300
Jiang Qiaoxi, for someone with such flair,

11:32.340 --> 11:34.720
this scarf is weirdly old-fashioned.

11:35.280 --> 11:36.720
You're the old-fashioned one.

11:36.760 --> 11:37.600
Put it on.

11:44.020 --> 11:45.080
Du Shang, come on!

11:53.040 --> 11:55.420
Yingtao, I'm beating you today!

11:56.440 --> 11:59.020
Catch me!

12:02.640 --> 12:04.020
Is that Jiang Qiaoxi?

12:05.600 --> 12:06.440
What's he doing here?

12:06.480 --> 12:07.700
I have no idea.

12:07.740 --> 12:08.880
Ms. He.

12:08.920 --> 12:10.220
All the other Olympiad students

12:10.260 --> 12:11.440
are leaving today.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.640
Why are you still here?

12:13.360 --> 12:15.320
I just wanted to sit in
a few more classes.

12:16.160 --> 12:18.060
I already cleared it with Ms. Peng.

12:18.100 --> 12:19.360
I'll take the exam tomorrow.

12:21.320 --> 12:22.960
Why are all of you wearing red scarves?

12:23.000 --> 12:24.240
Ms. He,

12:24.280 --> 12:25.660
we are wearing them

12:25.700 --> 12:27.580
to bring Jiang Qiaoxi good luck.

12:27.620 --> 12:28.460
- Yeah, Ms. He.
- Yeah.

12:30.400 --> 12:31.760
Alright then, hurry to class.

12:31.800 --> 12:32.940
Okay, we are going.

12:33.780 --> 12:35.120
Bye, Ms. He.

12:35.160 --> 12:36.000
Bye, Ms. He.

13:02.940 --> 13:04.980
Jiang Qiaoxi should be getting ready
for the competition.

13:05.020 --> 13:06.800
What's he doing goofing off with them?

13:07.400 --> 13:08.500
Being that childish?

13:26.740 --> 13:27.760
That's not him.

13:30.260 --> 13:31.440
What do you mean it's not?

13:33.080 --> 13:34.620
He's tall. Who else would it be?

13:36.320 --> 13:37.900
I said it's not him.

13:40.200 --> 13:42.180
He's never smiled like that.

13:46.000 --> 13:47.600
How can he look that happy?

13:51.460 --> 13:53.660
This drumstick is unreal today.

13:54.520 --> 13:55.580
So good.

13:55.620 --> 13:57.060
Yingtao. Yingtao.

13:57.100 --> 13:58.260
- The flavor is different.
- Hm?

13:58.300 --> 13:59.360
I want some stuffed lotus root.

13:59.400 --> 14:00.400
Could you spare me some?

14:00.940 --> 14:02.340
You want more food now?

14:02.380 --> 14:03.220
Delicious chicken leg.

14:03.260 --> 14:04.200
Not for now.

14:04.240 --> 14:06.240
- I'm saving it for the road.
- Different from yesterday,

14:06.280 --> 14:08.480
this drumstick is really amazing.

14:08.520 --> 14:09.380
Fine.

14:09.420 --> 14:10.720
I'll have my mom fry some tonight.

14:11.480 --> 14:12.660
I want pig trotters.

14:13.580 --> 14:14.420
I want jujube buns.

14:16.560 --> 14:17.400
Nope.

14:17.440 --> 14:18.800
- Why not, Yingtao?
- It's not fair.

14:18.840 --> 14:20.860
- Come on, it's been forever!
- Yeah.

14:20.900 --> 14:22.540
Those are handmade one by one.

14:22.580 --> 14:24.240
She'd be cooking all night and exhausted.

14:24.880 --> 14:26.560
Exactly, that's a lot for Auntie.

14:26.600 --> 14:27.520
Form a line.

14:28.780 --> 14:29.740
Jiang Qiaoxi.

14:29.780 --> 14:31.380
I call dibs on stuffed lotus root.

14:31.420 --> 14:32.580
I'm the second.

14:32.620 --> 14:34.040
- Then I'm the third.
- Fourth, obviously.

14:34.080 --> 14:35.080
Jiang Qiaoxi!

14:36.660 --> 14:37.720
Qiaoxi's mom.

14:37.760 --> 14:39.040
Hongfei.

14:39.080 --> 14:40.040
Calm down.

14:41.180 --> 14:42.600
Jiang Qiaoxi!

14:52.100 --> 14:53.240
So he took leave on his own?

14:53.840 --> 14:55.480
Skipped the Olympiad opening ceremony?

14:56.020 --> 14:57.020
He did tell me.

14:58.220 --> 14:59.900
Who gave him the right
to make that decision?

15:00.820 --> 15:02.420
Kids these day…

15:02.460 --> 15:04.360
I thought he was already on his way.

15:04.400 --> 15:05.420
I only found out

15:05.460 --> 15:06.760
he was here because Ms. He told me.

15:13.980 --> 15:14.820
Don't worry.

15:18.120 --> 15:19.440
It's almost over.

15:43.500 --> 15:45.020
I already booked tickets for tonight.

15:45.600 --> 15:46.500
He has to attend

15:47.380 --> 15:48.520
the opening.

15:51.140 --> 15:52.860
Principal, we'll be going.

15:52.900 --> 15:53.740
Alright.

16:33.740 --> 16:34.980
Now remember,

16:35.020 --> 16:35.880
first,

16:35.920 --> 16:36.760
don't panic.

16:37.640 --> 16:38.480
Clear your mind.

16:39.980 --> 16:41.980
Focus on the questions.

16:42.020 --> 16:43.740
Start with

16:43.780 --> 16:44.960
the high-score ones first.

16:45.920 --> 16:46.760
Math king Jiang.

16:47.980 --> 16:49.700
How are you feeling about the exam?

16:52.020 --> 16:53.280
You are?

16:54.700 --> 16:56.560
I knew it. You don't know me.

16:56.600 --> 16:57.680
My name's Qi Le.

16:57.720 --> 16:59.140
I'm in Year 10 at our school.

16:59.680 --> 17:01.940
I guessed the method on the last question

17:01.980 --> 17:03.680
during prelims, got lucky,

17:03.720 --> 17:05.180
and made it into nationals.

17:05.220 --> 17:07.280
I'm mostly here for the experience,

17:07.319 --> 17:08.160
not to win.

17:13.460 --> 17:16.380
Hi. I'm Jiang Qiaoxi.

17:16.420 --> 17:18.940
You don't need to introduce yourself.

17:18.980 --> 17:20.180
We all know who you are.

17:21.859 --> 17:22.740
My dad

17:22.780 --> 17:23.720
is the provincial

17:23.760 --> 17:25.440
team coach for China Math Olympiad.

17:26.780 --> 17:28.640
There, Mr. Qi.

17:29.960 --> 17:32.060
At home, he never shuts up about you.

17:32.100 --> 17:34.220
Says your math intuition is insane.

17:34.260 --> 17:37.260
One in a million. Sometimes I think
he wishes you were his son.

17:40.780 --> 17:43.120
You're never focused in practices.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.760
Now you are distracting other people?

17:46.220 --> 17:48.100
You see? I told you.

17:48.140 --> 17:49.160
He wants you as his son.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.400
Keep talking nonsense.

17:50.440 --> 17:51.880
See what happens when we get home.

17:56.020 --> 17:57.820
What's wrong? You don't look good.

18:00.000 --> 18:00.840
It's nothing.

18:01.500 --> 18:02.800
Just a slight fever.

18:04.760 --> 18:05.860
Falling sick now of all times?

18:05.900 --> 18:07.060
Did you take any medicine?

18:07.940 --> 18:08.920
Don't.

18:08.960 --> 18:10.480
They'll make you drowsy,

18:10.520 --> 18:11.860
You'll blank on everything.

18:12.420 --> 18:13.400
No meds, got it?

18:14.220 --> 18:15.180
Hey math king,

18:15.220 --> 18:17.220
did someone borrow your eraser
before the exam?

18:18.200 --> 18:20.380
- Eraser?
- There's this myth at China Math Olympiad.

18:20.420 --> 18:22.180
If someone borrows half your eraser

18:22.220 --> 18:23.340
before the exam,

18:23.380 --> 18:25.260
they steal half your luck.

18:25.300 --> 18:26.380
Math king,

18:26.920 --> 18:28.180
someone's trying to sabotage you.

18:28.220 --> 18:29.600
That's ridiculous.

18:29.640 --> 18:30.940
You study math

18:30.980 --> 18:33.080
and still go with that superstition?
Embarrassing.

18:33.120 --> 18:34.360
Come on, Dad.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.980
Math is kinda mystical.

18:36.020 --> 18:37.000
Think about it,

18:37.040 --> 18:37.960
if someone like me

18:38.000 --> 18:39.220
made it to nationals,

18:39.260 --> 18:40.240
it's dumb luck, right?

18:40.280 --> 18:41.580
This is not the time

18:42.220 --> 18:43.160
to mess around.

18:44.500 --> 18:45.400
Dad,

18:45.440 --> 18:47.260
look at Wang Shuran.
She's doing her own ritual.

18:49.800 --> 18:51.120
Rituals?

18:52.140 --> 18:54.500
Why did she write those words

18:54.540 --> 18:55.640
on her hands?

18:55.680 --> 18:57.580
Qi Le said

18:57.620 --> 18:59.240
there's a trick to it.

19:00.480 --> 19:02.480
Write the character for win

19:02.520 --> 19:04.260
16 times on your left hand,

19:04.300 --> 19:05.780
and rise 16 times

19:05.820 --> 19:06.920
on your right hand.

19:07.860 --> 19:09.180
Supposedly it boosts your luck.

19:09.220 --> 19:10.860
Really? New to me.

19:11.660 --> 19:12.940
Did you write it?

19:12.980 --> 19:14.620
Why would I?

19:14.660 --> 19:15.900
I don't need luck.

19:15.940 --> 19:16.780
Fair point.

19:18.160 --> 19:19.000
Hey, Jiang Qiaoxi.

19:20.880 --> 19:21.720
You sound

19:22.240 --> 19:24.100
a little bit off to me.

19:25.140 --> 19:26.720
Are you sick?

19:27.460 --> 19:28.920
I'm fine. Much better.

19:30.280 --> 19:31.700
Got a bit fever.

19:31.740 --> 19:33.160
No big deal now.

19:33.200 --> 19:34.780
You had a fever?

19:37.480 --> 19:39.520
Are you alright over there alone?

19:39.560 --> 19:41.420
Getting sick before the exam?

19:42.020 --> 19:43.400
Worst of luck.

19:45.000 --> 19:45.880
Heavens, help him.

19:45.920 --> 19:47.260
At least it is the last day.

19:47.300 --> 19:48.600
Hope it won't affect you.

19:48.640 --> 19:50.600
I don't need the heavens to watch over me.

19:51.740 --> 19:53.220
I just need

19:54.500 --> 19:55.940
Yingtao to watch over me.

19:56.600 --> 19:58.400
Me? Watch over you?

19:59.180 --> 20:01.080
You're still joking at a time like this?

20:01.120 --> 20:02.180
Relax.

20:02.720 --> 20:04.040
None of it gonna throw me off.

20:04.080 --> 20:05.180
It won't get in my way.

20:13.280 --> 20:15.540
Yingtao, I…

20:17.440 --> 20:18.780
I just want this to be over.

20:22.120 --> 20:23.660
I need this to be over.

20:25.880 --> 20:27.400
Nothing's gonna stop me.

20:28.400 --> 20:30.240
Why do you keep saying it recently?

20:30.280 --> 20:31.660
You want it to be over.

20:32.680 --> 20:34.200
What exactly will be over?

20:36.120 --> 20:37.140
Just wait.

20:38.740 --> 20:39.740
You'll know soon enough.

20:43.540 --> 20:44.680
Alright.

20:44.720 --> 20:45.760
Bye.

21:13.820 --> 21:15.480
Hey, you okay?

21:19.800 --> 21:21.120
Hey, you okay?

21:22.840 --> 21:23.680
Yeah.

21:24.700 --> 21:25.920
Just needed a second

21:25.960 --> 21:26.820
to reset.

21:27.720 --> 21:29.160
You sure you are okay?

21:30.160 --> 21:31.020
Yeah.

21:48.920 --> 21:54.600
Okay, so Sn equals An. We need to find An.

21:54.640 --> 21:55.740
How do solve this?

21:56.260 --> 21:57.360
What's the formula again?

22:06.580 --> 22:07.420
Quit laughing.

22:08.600 --> 22:09.720
Lin Qile,

22:09.760 --> 22:10.860
what did I just say?

22:19.320 --> 22:21.680
If Sn and An are known,

22:21.720 --> 22:23.020
how do we find An?

22:23.060 --> 22:25.460
- I say 50.
- 50?

22:25.500 --> 22:26.740
- 50!
- 52 for me.

22:26.780 --> 22:28.920
Write my name down. 50 and a breakfast.

22:28.960 --> 22:30.800
A whole breakfast?

22:30.840 --> 22:32.420
- Yep.
- 50 plus one meal.

22:32.460 --> 22:33.360
Someone's all in.

22:33.400 --> 22:35.440
- 50.
- 70.

22:35.480 --> 22:36.720
- What's going on?
- I'm counting.

22:37.580 --> 22:39.000
- Pick one.
- 30.

22:39.040 --> 22:40.260
Pick what?

22:40.300 --> 22:41.860
Who's gonna win the Olympiad.

22:41.900 --> 22:44.100
It's about to start.
Are you backing Jiang Qiaoxi?

22:52.400 --> 22:53.240
I'm not betting.

22:53.980 --> 22:54.840
Really?

22:54.880 --> 22:55.880
Let me see.

22:55.920 --> 22:57.040
That's not like you, Yingtao.

22:57.080 --> 22:58.460
Even Yu Qiao put money down

22:58.500 --> 22:59.600
to cheer him on.

23:00.560 --> 23:02.720
I'm not cheering him on.

23:02.760 --> 23:04.180
Just figured

23:04.220 --> 23:05.760
I'd squeeze a little out of the guy.

23:06.520 --> 23:07.660
Come on.

23:07.700 --> 23:08.840
Class is starting.

23:08.880 --> 23:10.540
Did you bet?

23:10.580 --> 23:12.780
I put down 20.

23:13.360 --> 23:15.600
They're all guessing

23:15.640 --> 23:17.480
who'll make the national team.

23:18.220 --> 23:19.300
Did you join in?

23:19.340 --> 23:20.600
Of course not.

23:21.140 --> 23:22.840
You're sick.

23:23.360 --> 23:24.820
I'm not about to mess around right now.

23:25.360 --> 23:26.800
So if I wasn't sick,

23:26.840 --> 23:28.240
you would?

23:28.280 --> 23:30.500
You think I'll make the team?

23:31.160 --> 23:33.160
Yeah, I do.

23:34.120 --> 23:35.260
But

23:35.300 --> 23:37.200
I still wouldn't join their little circus.

23:39.740 --> 23:40.700
I can tell

23:41.380 --> 23:43.680
they are just doing it for kicks.

23:43.720 --> 23:44.760
But

23:44.800 --> 23:47.260
I'm not using your competition for fun.

23:47.820 --> 23:48.920
You even know

23:48.960 --> 23:51.180
my risk-to-reward ratio?

23:51.220 --> 23:53.220
Risk-to-reward ratio?

23:54.160 --> 23:55.080
What's that?

23:55.120 --> 23:56.140
Risk-to-reward ratio?

23:56.700 --> 23:59.060
Math king, that's a term
in finance, right?

23:59.100 --> 24:00.020
How did that come up?

24:02.040 --> 24:03.620
Guess I should've made it clearer.

24:03.660 --> 24:05.900
Sorry if I confused you, Yingtao.

24:07.300 --> 24:09.380
Anyway, not like it matters.

24:09.420 --> 24:11.840
My ratio's probably terrible.

24:11.880 --> 24:14.840
If you are not in, no harm done.

24:14.880 --> 24:16.100
And I'll be back soon anyway.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.640
It'll all be over soon.

24:19.500 --> 24:22.540
What do you mean, Jiang Qiaoxi?

24:22.580 --> 24:25.300
I've been thinking about it all day.
Still don't get it.

24:26.560 --> 24:28.480
You talking about the Olympiad?

24:29.000 --> 24:30.020
Everything.

24:32.300 --> 24:33.660
All of it is going to be over.

24:39.460 --> 24:40.820
Well…

24:40.860 --> 24:43.040
I hope you

24:43.080 --> 24:44.100
crush it.

24:45.220 --> 24:46.220
Crush it?

24:47.620 --> 24:48.680
I like that.

24:49.460 --> 24:50.420
I need that right now.

24:51.500 --> 24:52.660
Thanks, Yingtao.

24:53.380 --> 24:54.840
Why are you being all polite?

24:55.500 --> 24:58.220
So when exactly are you coming back?

25:00.080 --> 25:01.440
Starting from today,

25:01.480 --> 25:03.600
on the fourth day, I will be back.

25:06.940 --> 25:07.780
Got it.

25:07.820 --> 25:09.300
Math king,

25:09.340 --> 25:10.740
- Jiang Qiaoxi.
- you coming in or not?

25:10.780 --> 25:13.100
- Jiang Qiaoxi?
- Yingtao,

25:13.920 --> 25:15.500
on the day I come back,

25:15.540 --> 25:16.940
will you come and pick me up?

25:18.820 --> 25:19.660
‪Okay?

25:21.440 --> 25:22.540
Sure.

25:23.200 --> 25:25.280
I'll be there.

25:49.160 --> 25:50.780
Congrats to all our winners today.

25:55.580 --> 25:57.340
You brought home gold

25:57.380 --> 25:59.920
from the Olympiad!

25:59.960 --> 26:01.040
Math king,

26:01.720 --> 26:04.280
if you hadn't gotten sick,

26:04.320 --> 26:05.680
you would've blown them all away.

26:06.800 --> 26:08.840
But honestly, with your capability,

26:09.540 --> 26:11.180
you'd be top of the city

26:11.220 --> 26:14.320
through the regular college entrance exam.

26:14.360 --> 26:15.780
No, top of the province.

26:17.120 --> 26:17.960
Thanks.

26:19.360 --> 26:20.400
But

26:21.840 --> 26:22.960
I don't think I'll need it.

26:23.000 --> 26:24.940
One contestant has truly outdone himself.

26:24.980 --> 26:27.680
Not only did he showcase

26:27.720 --> 26:28.920
exceptional skill,

26:28.960 --> 26:30.540
he achieved full marks

26:30.580 --> 26:31.820
at the China Math Olympiad!

26:33.160 --> 26:35.620
Let's give a round of applause

26:35.660 --> 26:37.900
to Jiang Qiaoxi
from Jialin Experimental High School!

26:39.060 --> 26:41.800
Math king, you really
kept that under wraps.

26:44.700 --> 26:46.020
Amazing.

26:46.760 --> 26:47.940
I knew it.

26:47.980 --> 26:48.980
He's a legend for a reason.

26:52.840 --> 26:56.080
OUTSTANDING STUDENT: JIANG QIAOXI

27:04.240 --> 27:05.240
Not only did Jiang Qiaoxi

27:05.280 --> 27:06.500
get a perfect score,

27:07.180 --> 27:08.160
he's also been selected

27:08.200 --> 27:09.480
for the national training camp

27:10.980 --> 27:12.320
and earned a guaranteed spot

27:12.360 --> 27:14.320
at Qingbei University.

27:30.760 --> 27:32.680
FLOURISHING BEYOND

27:32.720 --> 27:37.360
WITH LOVE, WE GROW TOGETHER

27:42.020 --> 27:42.860
DESTINATION JIALIN

27:42.900 --> 27:44.560
Look, that's Yingtao.

27:44.600 --> 27:45.440
ROOTED IN JIALIN, FLOURISHING BEYOND

27:45.480 --> 27:46.520
That's what she looks like.

27:46.560 --> 27:48.520
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- He was only gone for four days.

27:48.560 --> 27:50.600
He called her everyday.

27:50.640 --> 27:51.560
Each call was

27:51.600 --> 27:52.520
at least half an hour.

27:52.560 --> 27:53.420
All that rumors about

27:53.460 --> 27:54.900
he's cool and mysterious?

27:54.940 --> 27:56.120
Guy's a full-blown chatterbox.

27:56.160 --> 27:57.720
Still scored full marks

27:57.760 --> 27:58.920
and made the national team.

27:58.960 --> 28:00.380
He can talk as much as he wants.

28:03.980 --> 28:05.200
Alright, everyone,

28:05.920 --> 28:06.840
over here!

28:06.880 --> 28:08.200
Let's gather up!

28:12.000 --> 28:13.720
Feeling better?

28:14.260 --> 28:15.740
Much better. Barely feel it now.

28:17.240 --> 28:18.420
Have you eaten?

28:20.660 --> 28:22.700
- Not yet.
- How are you gonna

28:22.740 --> 28:24.680
get your strength back without food?

28:25.580 --> 28:26.960
Rushed out too fast.

28:28.100 --> 28:29.660
Let's get you something to eat.

28:30.300 --> 28:31.260
Sure. Sounds good.

28:31.300 --> 28:32.680
We were about to grab breakfast too.

28:32.720 --> 28:33.580
Let's go together.

28:38.640 --> 28:40.020
Extra chili for me.

28:40.060 --> 28:43.220
NUTRITIOUS MEALS

28:44.360 --> 28:45.380
- Here you go.
- Thanks.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.080
- And for you.
- Thanks.

28:52.060 --> 28:53.720
Senior, I'm Qi Le.

28:54.860 --> 28:56.300
You're Qi Le?

28:57.080 --> 28:58.640
I'm Lin Qile.

28:58.680 --> 29:00.760
Then wait,

29:00.800 --> 29:02.760
is your nickname Rongrong?

29:02.800 --> 29:03.860
Rongrong?

29:05.260 --> 29:06.100
For Qile Rongrong, happily ever after?

29:06.140 --> 29:07.660
Exactly!

29:14.000 --> 29:15.100
Is that Wukong?

29:17.300 --> 29:18.360
Journey to the West was

29:18.400 --> 29:19.640
Jiang Qiaoxi's favorite.

29:21.780 --> 29:22.640
Senior Lin,

29:22.680 --> 29:24.940
you and Jiang really
knew each other as kids?

29:25.960 --> 29:26.800
Yeah, we did.

29:29.500 --> 29:30.500
I read that book

29:30.540 --> 29:32.200
in middle school too.

29:32.240 --> 29:34.500
Really? I love it so much.

29:34.540 --> 29:37.080
"If the sky won't let me see clearly,
I'll tear it apart.

29:37.120 --> 29:39.980
If the earth won't hold my heart,
I'll shatter it.

29:40.020 --> 29:42.040
Let me understand by all living creatures.

29:42.080 --> 29:45.080
Let all the gods disappear into smoke."

29:48.040 --> 29:48.880
Let me see it.

29:49.940 --> 29:51.840
CAMPER ID

29:53.460 --> 29:55.220
Good thing you used that photo.

29:55.260 --> 29:57.400
Covers up the scar on your forehead.

29:57.940 --> 30:00.320
It's fine. Look, it's almost healed.

30:00.360 --> 30:02.260
You can still see it.

30:03.680 --> 30:05.000
Looks the same to me either way.

30:05.540 --> 30:06.640
I think I'd read it, too.

30:07.140 --> 30:11.720
BEEF NOODLES, ROUJIAMO, COFFEE, BUBBLE TEA

30:13.620 --> 30:15.860
Do you guys still have more exams?

30:16.700 --> 30:17.540
Nope,

30:17.580 --> 30:18.840
not anymore.

30:18.880 --> 30:20.240
I'm done too.

30:20.280 --> 30:21.980
I'm done because I didn't make it.

30:22.020 --> 30:24.140
I have to wait until next year
to try again.

30:24.180 --> 30:25.760
But our math king doesn't need to.

30:25.800 --> 30:27.280
He aced it with full marks.

30:27.320 --> 30:28.320
That's basically

30:28.360 --> 30:29.680
a passport to the math world.

30:30.700 --> 30:31.680
What does that mean?

30:31.720 --> 30:32.620
It means Jiang Qiaoxi

30:32.660 --> 30:33.940
got straight into the national

30:33.980 --> 30:34.920
training team.

30:34.960 --> 30:36.740
Next up is the international competition.

30:37.900 --> 30:39.040
International?

30:39.080 --> 30:40.540
Like, going abroad for competitions?

30:40.580 --> 30:41.880
I'll go get the bill.

30:41.920 --> 30:44.400
So Senior Jiang can skip all the classes

30:44.440 --> 30:45.780
and never come back to school?

30:45.820 --> 30:46.720
He's guaranteed admission

30:46.760 --> 30:47.980
to Qingbei University

30:52.900 --> 30:55.460
NUTRITIOUS MEALS

31:00.020 --> 31:01.800
- Let's go.
- Thanks, math king.

31:01.840 --> 31:03.100
- No problem.
- Thanks, senior.

31:06.240 --> 31:08.200
OLYMPIAD CAMPER ID

31:08.240 --> 31:09.080
Jiang Qiaoxi.

31:10.220 --> 31:11.240
You're not

31:11.280 --> 31:12.520
coming to school on Monday?

31:16.520 --> 31:17.360
I am.

31:20.000 --> 31:20.980
This whole thing…

31:25.440 --> 31:26.320
is over.

31:30.000 --> 31:31.840
Senior Jiang, you are not
joining the national team?

31:35.340 --> 31:37.560
I'm done with math competitions.
I'm going back to school.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.500
Done with math?

31:51.660 --> 31:52.840
No idea what's going on

31:52.880 --> 31:54.060
with Mr.Jiang's kid.

31:54.100 --> 31:55.880
He's got a guaranteed spot at Qingbei.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.760
He rejected it.

31:56.800 --> 31:57.980
What's that about?

31:58.020 --> 32:00.340
- That's wild. Who would say no to that?
- Yeah.

32:00.380 --> 32:01.800
APMO CERTIFICATE

32:01.840 --> 32:02.980
Mom, here.

32:03.020 --> 32:05.860
All my Olympiad notes and study materials,

32:05.900 --> 32:08.000
from when I was a kid until now.

32:08.680 --> 32:09.940
They're all categorized.

32:09.980 --> 32:11.120
If you want,

32:11.160 --> 32:12.360
you can tear them up in order.

32:13.100 --> 32:14.220
What is that supposed to mean?

32:18.220 --> 32:19.200
I knew it.

32:20.780 --> 32:21.820
I figured you forgot.

32:24.080 --> 32:25.580
Back in first grade,

32:26.720 --> 32:27.880
we just got back from Hong Kong,

32:29.980 --> 32:30.960
I didn't finish

32:31.820 --> 32:33.720
your math homework
because I was playing around.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.280
So you ripped up my Olympiad textbook.

32:39.180 --> 32:40.300
And you told me

32:40.340 --> 32:41.580
math was the only path I had.

32:41.620 --> 32:42.460
Nothing else.

32:43.320 --> 32:44.520
You told me to figure it out.

32:45.900 --> 32:46.780
Well, I did.

32:48.720 --> 32:50.780
And I'm saying it now.
I don't want that path.

32:53.260 --> 32:54.200
Is this some acting?

32:55.280 --> 32:57.900
A decade long revenge?

33:00.060 --> 33:00.900
No.

33:04.760 --> 33:06.340
I spent the decade to

33:07.680 --> 33:09.140
answer your question.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.980
Your path for math prodigy,

33:12.020 --> 33:12.980
I don't want it.

33:14.140 --> 33:15.020
I'm done.

33:17.360 --> 33:19.460
I really did give birth
to someone too smart.

33:20.600 --> 33:23.000
You knew exactly how to stab me
where it hurts most.

33:23.680 --> 33:25.380
You waited until now, when everything

33:25.420 --> 33:26.540
is in your hands,

33:26.580 --> 33:28.100
you are going to burn it all down?

33:29.880 --> 33:31.260
You really want me to believe

33:32.100 --> 33:34.900
I wasted all these years

33:35.500 --> 33:36.340
for nothing?

33:43.760 --> 33:45.980
Mom, I waited until now

33:47.660 --> 33:49.340
because only now

33:50.760 --> 33:52.800
will you actually listen.

33:53.520 --> 33:55.620
Only now will you finally see what I want

33:57.600 --> 33:58.880
I'm not Jiang Mengchu.

33:58.920 --> 34:00.820
I'm not anyone's shadow.

34:00.860 --> 34:01.900
I'm Jiang Qiaoxi.

34:01.940 --> 34:03.780
I have my own name, Mom.

34:03.820 --> 34:06.180
His name is the one
you should never bring up.

34:08.420 --> 34:09.400
He wasn't like you.

34:10.260 --> 34:12.340
He knew how hard I worked.

34:12.920 --> 34:14.960
At four years old, Mengchu told me

34:15.860 --> 34:17.580
he wanted to go to Qingbei University.

34:18.760 --> 34:21.080
He wanted to be the best mathematician
in the world.

34:22.760 --> 34:23.940
If he were still alive,

34:23.980 --> 34:25.860
he'd be so jealous of you.

34:33.520 --> 34:34.400
I'm sorry, Mom.

34:36.540 --> 34:38.480
But I'm the one who's still alive.

34:40.020 --> 34:42.380
That so-called genius life
he never got to live

34:42.420 --> 34:43.679
has nothing to do with me.

34:49.480 --> 34:50.820
Liang Hongfei, how could you…

34:51.360 --> 34:53.699
He's his own man now.
How can you get violent?

35:03.420 --> 35:04.500
You okay?

35:05.460 --> 35:06.300
I'm fine.

35:07.300 --> 35:08.140
Sit down.

35:15.640 --> 35:17.020
JIANG QIAOXI GOT HIT BY HIS MOM.

35:17.060 --> 35:18.380
HE NEVER WANTED TO JOIN THAT CAMP.

35:18.420 --> 35:20.300
Qiaoxi's such a good kid.

35:20.340 --> 35:22.260
Polite, smart, respectful.

35:22.300 --> 35:24.200
And Liang just keeps pushing him.

35:24.780 --> 35:26.340
That's not right.

35:26.380 --> 35:28.020
I've never really understood

35:28.060 --> 35:29.460
how Mrs. Liang treats Qiaoxi.

35:29.500 --> 35:30.820
The kid's always been well-behaved.

35:31.460 --> 35:32.540
Remember when he used to

35:32.580 --> 35:34.760
do homework at our place?

35:34.800 --> 35:36.680
He'd sit for hours,
breezing through stack of papers,

35:36.720 --> 35:38.380
like he was glued to the chair.

35:38.420 --> 35:40.060
And our Yingtao?

35:40.100 --> 35:41.780
Three minutes in,
she'd be off to the bathroom.

35:41.820 --> 35:44.180
Five minutes later, asking for a drink.

35:44.220 --> 35:45.260
She couldn't stay long.

35:45.300 --> 35:47.160
Like there were nails on the chair.

35:50.980 --> 35:51.960
Hello?

35:53.120 --> 35:54.400
Manager Cai.

35:55.200 --> 35:56.200
‪What?

35:57.540 --> 35:58.400
Alright,

35:58.940 --> 35:59.940
we are on our way.

35:59.980 --> 36:00.820
- What?
- Okay.

36:00.860 --> 36:01.860
Let's go.

36:01.900 --> 36:03.660
I'll tell you on the way.

36:04.240 --> 36:05.080
Qiaoxi,

36:05.760 --> 36:07.060
I know you are tired.

36:08.060 --> 36:09.500
Totally drained, body and mind.

36:10.040 --> 36:11.020
How about this?

36:11.740 --> 36:13.180
Let's take a trip.

36:13.220 --> 36:14.640
Take a proper break and relax for once.

36:15.440 --> 36:17.140
You've always wanted to see Tibet, right?

36:17.180 --> 36:18.680
Huangshan. Taishan.

36:18.720 --> 36:20.140
Any famous spot, you name it.

36:20.680 --> 36:21.800
Don't want to go with me?

36:22.420 --> 36:24.360
Bring your friends. Make it a group thing.

36:24.400 --> 36:25.960
We'll cover the cost.

36:26.620 --> 36:27.680
You can go wherever you want.

36:27.720 --> 36:28.720
- Even travel abroad…
- Dad.

36:28.760 --> 36:30.160
I am not making a scene here.

36:30.960 --> 36:32.700
I am not begging for a holiday.

36:32.740 --> 36:34.360
I just wanted to tell you,

36:35.060 --> 36:37.740
starting today, I don't want any of these.

36:37.780 --> 36:39.680
From this moment on, I have a name.

36:39.720 --> 36:40.820
I'm Jiang Qiaoxi!

36:40.860 --> 36:42.460
Qiaoxi, I was wrong.

36:42.500 --> 36:43.640
Please.

36:44.800 --> 36:46.800
I'm sorry I tore up your books.

36:47.800 --> 36:49.660
Please don't give up.

36:49.700 --> 36:50.940
You can't throw all this away.

36:50.980 --> 36:52.260
You've worked so hard.

36:52.300 --> 36:54.260
You were going to be
a world champion, you know?

36:54.300 --> 36:55.940
Don't you get it, Mom?

36:55.980 --> 36:57.020
Don't you know what I want?

36:57.560 --> 36:58.440
What do you want?

37:00.920 --> 37:02.320
That girl from Qunshan?

37:03.200 --> 37:04.900
It's because of her, isn't it?

37:05.460 --> 37:07.060
Is it?

37:10.280 --> 37:11.180
Of course.

37:15.140 --> 37:16.560
In you head,

37:18.500 --> 37:19.920
there's only one possible reason

37:19.960 --> 37:21.120
for all of this. Right?

37:22.160 --> 37:23.960
You used to be so obedient
when you were little.

37:25.140 --> 37:26.380
You were such a sweetheart.

37:27.020 --> 37:28.280
Everything changed

37:29.300 --> 37:30.740
after you went to Qunshan.

37:31.440 --> 37:32.640
After you met those people.

37:35.100 --> 37:36.360
Your dad and I

37:36.400 --> 37:38.260
sacrificed so much for you.

37:38.300 --> 37:40.240
What gives you the right
to just walk away?

37:40.280 --> 37:41.280
Mom, think about it.

37:42.360 --> 37:44.340
Was everything you did for me

37:46.120 --> 37:47.340
really for me?

37:48.440 --> 37:49.560
You and Dad were so strict

37:49.600 --> 37:50.920
because you were scared.

37:54.080 --> 37:55.900
I remember when you were drunk one night.

37:55.940 --> 37:57.380
You looked at me and said,

37:57.420 --> 37:58.600
"Jiang Mengchu,

38:00.640 --> 38:01.640
it was my fault.

38:04.100 --> 38:05.280
I should've picked you up.

38:07.160 --> 38:08.720
I shouldn't have let your dad do it.

38:08.760 --> 38:09.700
He's always late."

38:11.140 --> 38:12.220
That's when I figured it out.

38:13.100 --> 38:15.820
Jiang Mengchu skipped
Olympiad class that day.

38:16.320 --> 38:17.640
You didn't pick him up.

38:17.680 --> 38:19.140
- So he…
- Jiang Qiaoxi, stop.

38:21.580 --> 38:23.400
The older I get, the clearer it becomes.

38:24.140 --> 38:26.020
You wanted him to be a math genius.

38:26.060 --> 38:27.360
But all he wanted

38:27.900 --> 38:30.200
was to get far, far away from you.

38:31.160 --> 38:32.440
13 years old.

38:32.480 --> 38:34.840
He disappeared on a tiny hill
right near home.

38:34.880 --> 38:37.760
- Do you really believe that was just…
- Don't talk about him like that!

38:37.800 --> 38:39.640
Jiang Qiaoxi, how could you do this

38:39.680 --> 38:42.040
to your brother? To your dead brother?

38:42.080 --> 38:43.020
What did I do?

38:44.400 --> 38:45.720
Who really failed him?

38:45.760 --> 38:46.960
What are you saying?

38:47.000 --> 38:48.920
Mengchu had your eyes.

38:48.960 --> 38:50.340
He shared your blood.

38:50.380 --> 38:52.180
- He wouldn't think like this.
- Exactly.

38:52.220 --> 38:54.360
He had my blood.

38:54.400 --> 38:56.240
My eyes.

38:56.280 --> 38:58.280
Everything I am,
my skin, my bones, my blood,

38:58.320 --> 38:59.460
that's given to me by you!

38:59.500 --> 39:01.340
These awards. These math medals.

39:01.380 --> 39:02.960
They're all yours.

39:03.000 --> 39:03.960
Isn't this what you want?

39:04.640 --> 39:05.960
Then fine. I'll return it all.

39:06.000 --> 39:07.420
I'm only going to be me!

39:07.460 --> 39:08.800
Jiang Qiaoxi.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.000
Jiang Qiaoxi.

39:37.440 --> 39:39.020
We're having hot pot

39:40.220 --> 39:41.260
tonight.

39:43.240 --> 39:44.720
You coming?

39:45.320 --> 39:46.860
You know me.

39:47.700 --> 39:49.700
I'm not great at hot pot.

39:49.740 --> 39:51.560
But if you are there,

39:52.280 --> 39:53.480
fighting me over food,

39:54.900 --> 39:56.460
I'll probably eat a ton.

40:08.060 --> 40:08.900
Come on,

40:10.680 --> 40:12.140
Jiang Qiaoxi.

40:25.600 --> 40:26.480
Come with me.

40:50.160 --> 40:51.520
Sit here.

41:04.380 --> 41:05.220
Hold on.

41:09.760 --> 41:13.080
We have to disinfect your wound.

41:13.120 --> 41:14.280
Let me grab the iodine.

41:14.320 --> 41:15.840
Once that's done,

41:15.880 --> 41:17.400
we can eat.

41:17.440 --> 41:19.160
My mom made crispy pork, too.

41:19.760 --> 41:21.120
You have to eat some more

41:21.160 --> 41:22.320
so that I can have more too.

41:25.260 --> 41:26.540
How about this?

41:26.580 --> 41:27.740
You

41:27.780 --> 41:28.800
count to ten.

41:28.840 --> 41:30.080
I'll be back

41:30.120 --> 41:31.080
before you finish.

42:13.920 --> 42:16.180
I'M FINE. DIDN'T THINK ABOUT HIM LATELY.
DOES HE STILL REMEMBER THE TASTE OF HONEY?

42:18.940 --> 42:20.540
Jiang Qiaoxi left.

42:22.880 --> 42:24.420
He doesn't write.

42:25.020 --> 42:26.540
Doesn't call.

42:28.140 --> 42:30.120
I'm done thinking about him.

42:32.760 --> 42:34.980
I'm done getting hurt over him.

42:35.020 --> 42:35.900
NO MORE HURTING FOR HIM!
SEP 16TH, 2006

44:59.500 --> 45:02.820
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
